.TH FORGEKIT-DOCTOR 1 "2026-08-25" "ForgeKit 0.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
forgekit-doctor \- Diagnose the development environment and project health
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B forgekit doctor
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check the development environment and project health. Validates ForgeKit
version, project signature, installed features, Go/Git/Docker availability,
PostgreSQL configuration, project structure, architecture rules, security,
dependencies, and documentation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-ci
CI/CD mode: non-interactive, deterministic, exit codes 0/1/2, no spinners
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug output
.TP
.B \-\-format \fIformat\fR
Output format: human, json (default: human)
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Reduce output (except errors and JSON)
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Run doctor check:
.B forgekit doctor
.TP
Run in CI mode:
.B forgekit doctor --ci
.TP
Run with JSON output:
.B forgekit doctor --format json
.SH CHECKS PERFORMED
.TP
.B ForgeKit Version
Current version and update availability
.TP
.B Project Signature
.forge/forge.yaml and .forge/features.yaml validation
.TP
.B Installed Features
Feature versions vs registry
.TP
.B Environment
Go, Git, Docker availability
.TP
.B PostgreSQL
Configuration and connectivity
.TP
.B Project Structure
go.mod, .env, docker-compose.yml presence
.TP
.B Architecture Rules
Security, dependencies, documentation
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
All checks passed
.TP
.B 1
Warnings or errors found
.TP
.B 2
Execution error
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ./forge.yaml
Project configuration
.TP
.I ./.forge/features.yaml
Installed features
.TP
.I .env.example
Environment template
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR forgekit (1),
.BR forgekit-analyze (1),
.BR forgekit-check (1)
.SH AUTHOR
ForgeKit Contributors <forgekit@demetrius-ch.github.io>